# Articles (docs/LEXICON_FORMAT_FR.md §6). Written from own knowledge (clean-room).
# The contractions au, aux, du, des, ès are in prepositions.lex.
le        det  type=art definite=def forms=le,la,les,les elided=l'
un        det  type=art definite=ind forms=un,une,des,des
du        det  type=art definite=ind gender=m number=sg note=partitive article (du pain); de la, de l' are two tokens
